      "body": "@mssalvatore thanks for the screenshot of your cookies. I have found the issue and have a fix proposed to the cookie-policy module. Sorry about this but should be resolved shortly. \r\n\r\nIf you would like a short term fix you can simply delete your cookie with the `/security` path. That will allow the script to use the value of the root path cookie. ",
